{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55321","headline":"赠金励睡诗 一 · 陈抟","name":"赠金励睡诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常人无所重，惟睡乃爲重。\n举世皆爲息，魂离神不动。\n觉来无所知，贪求心愈用。\n堪笑尘中人（《事文类聚》作「尘世中」），不知梦是梦。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}